agents/retro.md
3:description: Use this agent with every architecture review, or immediately when log-event.sh prints RETRO DUE. Mines vault/log.jsonl for process failures that recurred across slices (reviewer rejections, tiebreaks, escalations, human corrections), traces each to the rule that let it through, and proposes the strongest fix — a mechanical check before more text. Returns proposals as text; never edits anything.
