agents/planner.md
3:description: Use after /grill produces a spec, to decompose one feature into vertical slices. Reads the codebase so the Director doesn't have to, writes vault/handoffs/plan-draft.json, and returns a ≤ 20-line slice table. Never writes application code and never touches task-tree.json.
